# Mjidea Reports Folder

All audits and phase reports for this project must land as Markdown under:

`/media/mj/My Passport/mjI/Mjidea/reports/`

## Subfolders

| Type | Path |
|------|------|
| Research / citations | `reports/research/` |
| Audit | `reports/audit/` |
| Security | `reports/security/` |
| SEO | `reports/seo/` |
| Growth | `reports/growth/` |
| War-room packs / briefs / drafts | `reports/war-room/` |
| CEO one-pagers | `reports/ceo/` |

## Filename

`YYYY-MM-DD-<slug>-<type>.md`

## Pipeline dual-write

1. Keep war-room pipeline outputs in `war-room/briefs/` and `war-room/output/` (unchanged).
2. **Also copy/mirror** research, audit, security, SEO, growth, and CEO summaries into the matching `reports/` subfolder.
3. Update `team/STATUS.md` as usual; lasting status narratives can also go in `reports/ceo/` when they are deliverables.

See `reports/README.md`. Global rule: user `~/.cursor/rules/reports-in-project-folder.mdc`.
